      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EDGE ELEVEN (1) was responsible for a very good effort last time over 2185m at this track, finishing second and just 1.5 metres from the winner. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Good enough to put herself in the winners' stall. JETPACK (12) finished runner-up last time out, beaten a nose, in a nice return to form at Gloucester Park over 1730m. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. Meets a similar line up so he can go one better this time around. XCELERATOR (8) is in the mix following a fifth at his most recent appearance over 2100m at Bunbury. SAPARI (2) is ready to improve after debuting with a respectable fifth last time out over 2130m at Gloucester Park.",
